---
---
<section id="services">
  <div class="services-header">
    <h2 class="services-headline reveal">
      Three ways<br />we show up.
    </h2>
    <p class="services-note reveal reveal-delay-1">
      Each engagement is different. But every one passes through the same three moments.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="services-grid">
    <div class="service-card reveal">
      <span class="service-facet">The Eyes</span>
      <h3 class="service-name">Strategy &amp;<br />Brand Audit</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">
        Before we build anything, we look. We study your market, your users, and your existing presence — and tell you
        honestly what's working, what isn't, and what your brand is missing.
      </p>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>Competitor landscape review</li>
        <li>User experience audit</li>
        <li>Brand positioning report</li>
        <li>Content and copy strategy</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <span class="service-facet">The Mouth</span>
      <h3 class="service-name">Design &amp;<br />Visual Identity</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">
        We give your brand a voice it didn't know it had. Every colour, typeface, and layout choice is deliberate —
        nothing is there by default. The result speaks clearly, even in silence.
      </p>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>Logo and identity systems</li>
        <li>Web UI and UX design</li>
        <li>Motion and micro-interactions</li>
        <li>Design systems and style guides</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <span class="service-facet">The Spread</span>
      <h3 class="service-name">Development &amp;<br />Launch</h3>
      <p class="service-desc">
        A design is only as good as its execution. We build fast, accessible, and production-ready — then we help you
        put it in front of the world and make sure it stays there.
      </p>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>Custom web development</li>
        <li>CMS integration and setup</li>
        <li>Performance optimisation</li>
        <li>Post-launch support</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
